e [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ring with its age, `⟳ 9d` when due). The mark agrees exactly with [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the review queue wherever it shows a review state, and the stored [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]syntax, both implementations, and every stamping path stay [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fresh_mark.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/fresh_mark.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3a[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3a/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Display contract and pure mark model[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mark-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mark-core: write the freshness-mark display contract and its M/N/C [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]conformance vectors into docs/freshness.md. Then implement the pure, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exported bob-ledger-tools helpers (source detection, resolution, model, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]consensus, tooltip, DOM builder) and the mark styles, and test them [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against the vectors verbatim.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Live Preview decoration and rendered-view marks[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mark-surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mark-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mark-surfaces: wire the model into Obsidian. Add a Prec.highest [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CodeMirror ViewPlugin that replaces canonical stamps in Live Preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with reveal-on-cursor and click-to-reveal. Add a markdown post-processor[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for reading view and Tasks query results, a filesystem-free cached mark [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot refreshed on the status bar paths, a session toggle command, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the repair flag on leftover Dataview pills, all with stubbed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CodeMirror tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Release, docs, deploy, and live-verify gate[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mark-rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mark-surfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mark-rollout: bump bob-ledger-tools to 1.10.0, update both READMEs, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Surfaces table, and the vault snippet comment, run the full plugin suite[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and manifest validation, deploy with bob plugins sync, and record the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-verify checklist Bryan runs in Obsidian.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3a","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3a.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1a2b02f5faf047113f452a214e79a10a","started_at":"2026-10-01T15:20:10.233618+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"58ab4261676f61df762ce5925ccbcf567f52330c043ffd2dd0dba603ece8cbee","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3a.2/chat.md","size_bytes":3342},"commits":{"digest":"3ed08d0861f647cb490ee65bfff0a44170df080a6327ac002de079f9bc4f2536","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3a.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a6